  "appliesTo": "Statutory academic year calendar published by Bradford Council on Bradford Schools Online; the council's main site sends parents to the Schools Finder for each school's holiday dates.",
  "academyNote": "The council page does not list which schools follow the calendar; it says to use the Schools Finder to find details about Bradford District schools including school holiday dates.",
  "localFacts": [
    {
      "fact": "Bradford's 2026-27 calendar marks Wednesday 10 March 2027 and Monday 17 May 2027 as the likely dates for Eid, and keeps both as school days.",
      "source": "https://bso.bradford.gov.uk/userfiles/file/IMT/Bradford%20Term%20Dates%202026-27.pdf"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The council normally expects schools with a significant number of pupils celebrating Eid to consider this when they set their dates.",
      "source": "https://bso.bradford.gov.uk/userfiles/file/IMT/Bradford%20Term%20Dates%202026-27.pdf"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Each calendar identifies 195 days (190 pupil days plus 5 INSET), and schools choose their five INSET days within this schedule.",
      "source": "https://bso.bradford.gov.uk/userfiles/file/IMT/SchoolHolidays/Bradford%20Term%20Dates%202027-28.pdf"
    },
    {
      "fact": "To find when a specific school has chosen to take its INSET days, Bradford points to its School Finder.",
      "source": "https://bso.bradford.gov.uk/content/data-guidance-for-schools/term-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The calendars are published as Word and PDF files on Bradford Schools Online, the council's site for schools.",
      "source": "https://bso.bradford.gov.uk/content/data-guidance-for-schools/term-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The autumn term 2026-27 starts on Tuesday 1 September 2026 and the autumn term 2027-28 on Monday 6 September 2027.",
      "source": "https://bso.bradford.gov.uk/userfiles/file/IMT/SchoolHolidays/Bradford%20Term%20Dates%202027-28.pdf"
    },
    {
      "fact": "In 2028 the Easter holiday runs from Monday 10 April to Friday 21 April, so the spring term lasts until Friday 7 April.",
      "source": "https://bso.bradford.gov.uk/userfiles/file/IMT/SchoolHolidays/Bradford%20Term%20Dates%202027-28.pdf"
    }
  ],
